{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program' data-target='computer\/program' data-title='Program'>\r\n\t\t\tProgram\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_tomcat' data-title='Apache Tomcat'>\r\n\t\t\tApache Tomcat\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on Context - Resources: <Resource name=\"jdbc/postgres\" auth=\"Container\", if ( cxt == null ), and if ( ds == null ).","label":"Context - Resources","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/context_parameters","label":"Context - parameters","url":"\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/context_parameters"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/context_xml","label":"Context.xml","url":"\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/context_xml"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;Context&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>&lt;Resource name=\"jdbc\/postgres\" auth=\"Container\"<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tType=\"javax.sql.DataSource\" driverClassName=\"org.postgresql.Driver\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tUrl=\"jdbc:postgresql:\/\/127.0.0.1:5432\/mydb\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tUsername=\"myuser\" password=\"mypasswd\" maxActive=\"20\" maxIdle=\"10\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tMaxWait=\"-1\"\/&gt;.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;\/Context&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>web.xml configuration.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;resource-ref&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;description&gt;postgreSQL Datasource example&lt;\/description&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;description&gt;postgreSQL &lt;res-ref-name&gt;jdbc\/postgres&lt;\/res-ref-name&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;res-ref-name&gt;jdbc\/postgres&lt;\/res-ref-name&gt; &lt;res-type&gt;javax.sql.DataSource&lt;\/res-type&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;res-type&gt;javax.sql.DataSource&lt;\/res-type&gt; &lt;res-auth&gt;Container&lt;\/res-auth&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;resource-ref&gt; &lt;\/resource-ref&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tInitialContext cxt = new InitialContext();.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>if ( cxt == null ) {<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tThrow new Exception(\"Uh oh -- no context!\");.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t}.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDataSource ds = (DataSource) cxt.lookup( \"java:\/comp\/env\/jdbc\/postgres\" );.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>if ( ds == null ) {<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tThrow new Exception(\"Data source not found!\");.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t}.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/context_resources\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/context_resources\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n